      "text": "Hand {hand_number} of {hands} is dealt: {cards_dealt_per_player} cards each. The trump card is {trump_card} (trump suit: {trump_suit}). Seat {leader} leads the first trick."
    },
    {
      "use": "sync",
      "phase": "deal",
      "label": "your cards",
      "when": {
        "calc": "trick_in_hand == 1"
      },
      "mode": "self",
      "to": "all",
      "fields": [
        "hand",
        "score"
      ],
      "text": "Hand {hand_number}: trump card {trump_card}, trump suit {trump_suit}, seat {leader} leads. Your cards:"
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "bid",
      "label": "the bids",
      "when": {
        "calc": "trick_in_hand == 1"
      },
      "to": "acting",
      "answer": {
        "type": "number",
        "min": {
          "calc": "bid_min"
        },
        "max": {
          "calc": "bid_max"
        }
      },
      "store": "bid",
      "text": "Hand {hand_number}: trump card {trump_card} (trump suit {trump_suit}); seat {leader} leads. Look at your cards and secretly bid how many of the 3 tricks you will take: a whole number from {bid_min} to {bid_max}. A missing or invalid bid counts as {default_bid}. Bids are revealed when all are in."
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "bid",
      "label": "bids revealed",
      "when": {
        "calc": "trick_in_hand == 1"
      },
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Bids for hand {hand_number}: Seat 1 bids {players[0].bid}, Seat 2 bids {players[1].bid}, Seat 3 bids {players[2].bid}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "trick",
      "label": "start of trick",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "led_suit",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "wizard_played",
            "value": false
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "best_value",
            "value": {
              "calc": "no_card_strength"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "best_seat",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "played_card",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "offer",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[c for c in you.hand if c[0] == led_suit or c[0] in ['W', 'J']] if (led_suit in ['R', 'B', 'G'] and count(c[0] == led_suit for c in you.hand) > 0) else you.hand"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "fallback",
            "value": {
              "calc": "(([c for c in ['R1', 'B1', 'G1', 'R2', 'B2', 'G2', 'R3', 'B3', 'G3', 'R4', 'B4', 'G4', 'R5', 'B5', 'G5', 'R6', 'B6', 'G6', 'R7', 'B7', 'G7', 'R8', 'B8', 'G8'] if c in you.hand and c[0] == led_suit] if led_suit in ['R', 'B', 'G'] else []) + [c for c in ['J1', 'J2'] if c in you.hand] + [c for c in ['R1', 'B1', 'G1', 'R2', 'B2', 'G2', 'R3', 'B3', 'G3', 'R4', 'B4', 'G4', 'R5', 'B5', 'G5', 'R6', 'B6', 'G6', 'R7', 'B7', 'G7', 'R8', 'B8', 'G8'] if c in you.hand] + [c for c in ['W1', 'W2'] if c in you.hand] + [''])[0]"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Trick {trick_in_hand} of hand {hand_number}: seat {leader} leads."
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "trick",
      "label": "the lead",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == leader"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "offer"
        }
      },
      "verify": {
        "bind": "p1"
      },
      "text": "Trick {trick_in_hand} of hand {hand_number}. You lead. Trump suit: {trump_suit}. Cards played this hand: {played_cards}. Play one card from those offered."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "trick",
      "label": "the lead is played",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "card",
            "value": {
              "calc": "$p1 if $p1 in players[leader - 1].offer else players[leader - 1].fallback"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "leader"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "card"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "leader"
            },
            "key": "played_card",
            "value": {
              "calc": "card"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} plays {value}."
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "played_cards",
            "value": {
              "calc": "card"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "led_suit",
            "value": {
              "calc": "card[0]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "card[0] in ['R', 'B', 'G'] and led_suit == '' and not wizard_played"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "led_suit",
            "value": "none",
            "if": {
              "calc": "card[0] == 'W' and led_suit == ''"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "wizard_played",
            "value": true,
            "if": {
              "calc": "card[0] == 'W'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "strength",
            "value": {
              "calc": "wizard_strength if card[0] == 'W' else (jester_strength if card[0] == 'J' else (trump_strength_bonus + int(card[1]) if card[0] == trump_suit else (int(card[1]) if card[0] == led_suit else offsuit_strength)))"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "best_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "leader"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "strength > best_value"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "best_value",
            "value": {
              "calc": "strength"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "strength > best_value"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "offer",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[c for c in you.hand if c[0] == led_suit or c[0] in ['W', 'J']] if (led_suit in ['R', 'B', 'G'] and count(c[0] == led_suit for c in you.hand) > 0) else you.hand"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "fallback",
            "value": {
              "calc": "(([c for c in ['R1', 'B1', 'G1', 'R2', 'B2', 'G2', 'R3', 'B3', 'G3', 'R4', 'B4', 'G4', 'R5', 'B5', 'G5', 'R6', 'B6', 'G6', 'R7', 'B7', 'G7', 'R8', 'B8', 'G8'] if c in you.hand and c[0] == led_suit] if led_suit in ['R', 'B', 'G'] else []) + [c for c in ['J1', 'J2'] if c in you.hand] + [c for c in ['R1', 'B1', 'G1', 'R2', 'B2', 'G2', 'R3', 'B3', 'G3', 'R4', 'B4', 'G4', 'R5', 'B5', 'G5', 'R6', 'B6', 'G6', 'R7', 'B7', 'G7', 'R8', 'B8', 'G8'] if c in you.hand] + [c for c in ['W1', 'W2'] if c in you.hand] + [''])[0]"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "trick",
      "label": "the second card",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == leader % 3 + 1"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "offer"
        }
      },
      "verify": {
        "bind": "p2"
      },
      "text": "Trick {trick_in_hand} of hand {hand_number}. Led suit: {led_suit}. Trump suit: {trump_suit}. Cards played this hand: {played_cards}. Play one card from those offered."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "trick",
      "label": "the second card is played",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "card",
            "value": {
              "calc": "$p2 if $p2 in players[leader % 3].offer else players[leader % 3].fallback"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "leader % 3 + 1"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "card"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "leader % 3 + 1"
            },
            "key": "played_card",
            "value": {
              "calc": "card"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} plays {value}."
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "played_cards",
            "value": {
              "calc": "card"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "led_suit",
            "value": {
              "calc": "card[0]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "card[0] in ['R', 'B', 'G'] and led_suit == '' and not wizard_played"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "led_suit",
            "value": "none",
            "if": {
              "calc": "card[0] == 'W' and led_suit == ''"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "wizard_played",
            "value": true,
            "if": {
              "calc": "card[0] == 'W'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "strength",
            "value": {
              "calc": "wizard_strength if card[0] == 'W' else (jester_strength if card[0] == 'J' else (trump_strength_bonus + int(card[1]) if card[0] == trump_suit else (int(card[1]) if card[0] == led_suit else offsuit_strength)))"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "best_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "leader % 3 + 1"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "strength > best_value"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "best_value",
            "value": {
              "calc": "strength"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "strength > best_value"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "offer",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[c for c in you.hand if c[0] == led_suit or c[0] in ['W', 'J']] if (led_suit in ['R', 'B', 'G'] and count(c[0] == led_suit for c in you.hand) > 0) else you.hand"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "fallback",
            "value": {
              "calc": "(([c for c in ['R1', 'B1', 'G1', 'R2', 'B2', 'G2', 'R3', 'B3', 'G3', 'R4', 'B4', 'G4', 'R5', 'B5', 'G5', 'R6', 'B6', 'G6', 'R7', 'B7', 'G7', 'R8', 'B8', 'G8'] if c in you.hand and c[0] == led_suit] if led_suit in ['R', 'B', 'G'] else []) + [c for c in ['J1', 'J2'] if c in you.hand] + [c for c in ['R1', 'B1', 'G1', 'R2', 'B2', 'G2', 'R3', 'B3', 'G3', 'R4', 'B4', 'G4', 'R5', 'B5', 'G5', 'R6', 'B6', 'G6', 'R7', 'B7', 'G7', 'R8', 'B8', 'G8'] if c in you.hand] + [c for c in ['W1', 'W2'] if c in you.hand] + [''])[0]"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "trick",
      "label": "the third card",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == (leader + 1) % 3 + 1"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "offer"
        }
      },
      "verify": {
        "bind": "p3"
      },
      "text": "Trick {trick_in_hand} of hand {hand_number}. Led suit: {led_suit}. Trump suit: {trump_suit}. Cards played this hand: {played_cards}. Play one card from those offered."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "trick",
      "label": "the third card is played",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "card",
            "value": {
              "calc": "$p3 if $p3 in players[(leader + 1) % 3].offer else players[(leader + 1) % 3].fallback"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "(leader + 1) % 3 + 1"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "card"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "(leader + 1) % 3 + 1"
            },
            "key": "played_card",
            "value": {
              "calc": "card"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} plays {value}."
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "played_cards",
            "value": {
              "calc": "card"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "led_suit",
            "value": {
              "calc": "card[0]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "card[0] in ['R', 'B', 'G'] and led_suit == '' and not wizard_played"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "led_suit",
            "value": "none",
            "if": {
              "calc": "card[0] == 'W' and led_suit == ''"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "wizard_played",
            "value": true,
            "if": {
              "calc": "card[0] == 'W'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "strength",
            "value": {
              "calc": "wizard_strength if card[0] == 'W' else (jester_strength if card[0] == 'J' else (trump_strength_bonus + int(card[1]) if card[0] == trump_suit else (int(card[1]) if card[0] == led_suit else offsuit_strength)))"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "best_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "(leader + 1) % 3 + 1"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "strength > best_value"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "best_value",
            "value": {
              "calc": "strength"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "strength > best_value"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "trick",
      "label": "the trick is won",
      "do": [
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "best_seat"
            },
            "key": "tricks_taken",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "leader",
            "value": {
              "calc": "best_seat"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Seat {best_seat} wins trick {trick_in_hand} and leads next. Tricks taken: Seat 1 {players[0].tricks_taken}, Seat 2 {players[1].tricks_taken}, Seat 3 {players[2].tricks_taken}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "scoring",
      "label": "the hand is scored",
      "when": {
        "calc": "trick_in_hand == 3"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "score",
            "value": {
              "calc": "exact_base + exact_per_bid * you.bid if you.tricks_taken == you.bid else -miss_penalty_per_trick * abs(you.tricks_taken - you.bid)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "hands_done",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Hand {hand_number} is scored. Seat 1: bid {players[0].bid}, took {players[0].tricks_taken}, score {players[0].score}. Seat 2: bid {players[1].bid}, took {players[1].tricks_taken}, score {players[1].score}. Seat 3: bid {players[2].bid}, took {players[2].tricks_taken}, score {players[2].score}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "scoring",
      "label": "next trick",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "tricks_taken",
            "value": 0,
            "if": {
              "calc": "trick_in_hand == 3"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "trick_in_hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "trick_in_hand % 3 + 1"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "check",
      "phase": "scoring",
      "label": "after hand 12",
      "when": {
        "calc": "hands_done >= hands"
      },
      "against": [
        "over"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "end": {
    "over": {
      "when": {
        "calc": "hands_done >= hands"
      },
      "rank_by": "you.score",
      "text": "Winner: {result}. Final scores: Seat 1 {players[0].score}, Seat 2 {players[1].score}, Seat 3 {players[2].score}."
    }
  },
  "limits": {
    "rounds": 36,
    "rounds_max": 40,
    "actions_max": 2000,
    "deadline_s": 120
  },
  "rules": "Wizard Triad is for three players, P1, P2 and P3 (seats 1, 2, 3). Play always proceeds 1 -> 2 -> 3 -> 1. There is no talk phase.\n\nDECK: {deck_size} cards. Three suits (Red R, Blue B, Green G), each with ranks {rank_min} to {rank_max}, plus {wizards} Wizards (W1, W2) and {jesters} Jesters (J1, J2).\n\nThe game is {hands} hands of {tricks_per_hand} tricks each ({total_rounds} rounds).\n\nSTART OF A HAND: all {deck_size} cards are shuffled and {cards_dealt_per_player} cards are dealt face down to each player; you see only your own. The next card (card {trump_card_position}) is turned face up as the trump card. If it is suited, that suit is trump for the hand; if it is a Wizard or a Jester, there is no trump this hand. Then all three players at the same moment secretly bid {bid_min} to {bid_max} tricks. A missing or invalid bid counts as {default_bid}. All bids are then revealed; they need not add up to 3. The first lead of hand h goes to seat ((h - 1) mod 3) + 1: P1 for hands 1, 4, 7, 10; P2 for hands 2, 5, 8, 11; P3 for hands 3, 6, 9, 12.\n\nEACH TRICK: the leader plays one card face up, then the next seat in order, then the third. The led suit is the suit of the first suited card played in the trick, but only if no Wizard was played before it; if a Wizard is played before any suited card, the trick has no led suit. A Wizard or a Jester may always be played. If there is a led suit and you hold a card of it, you must play a Wizard, a Jester or a card of the led suit; otherwise you may play any card you hold. You are offered only your legal cards. If your choice is missing or not a legal card you hold, the engine plays for you, in this order: (a) if there is a led suit and you hold a card of it, your lowest card of the led suit; (b) otherwise a Jester if you hold one; (c) otherwise your lowest suited card, ties broken Red before Blue before Green; (d) otherwise a Wizard.\n\nWINNING A TRICK: if any Wizard was played, the first Wizard played wins. Otherwise, if any trump was played, the highest trump wins. Otherwise the highest card of the led suit wins. If no card qualifies, the first Jester played wins. All played cards stay visible for the rest of the hand. The winner adds 1 to their tricks taken and leads the next trick of the hand.\n\nEND OF A HAND: if your tricks taken equal your bid exactly, you score {exact_base} + {exact_per_bid} x bid (bid 0 = 30, 1 = 35, 2 = 40, 3 = 45). If not, you lose {miss_penalty_per_trick} x |tricks taken - bid| (for example, bid 2 and take 0 = -20). Scores, bids and tricks taken are announced, tricks taken reset to 0 and all cards are collected.\n\nEND OF GAME: after hand {hands}, the highest total score wins; players tied for the highest total share the result (a draw)."
}
